'[Mission Dialog]'

'[info]'
Title = "Lost Convoy";
briefing = "Lost Convoy
Date: October 3, 1993 - 1745 hours
Location:  Mogadishu, Somalia 

Situation:
Super Six One has been hit with a rocket-propelled grenade and has gone down northeast of the target building. Take the convoy to the crash site and secure it. We need to get a team there before the Habr Gedir overrun their position. ";
briefing2 = "<cFC8932>Lost Convoy<-co>
FRAGO: 2 TFR  REF: OPORD 10-93 TFR Date Time: 031745 October 93 

1. <ucFC8932>Situation<-uco>
Super Six One has been hit with an RPG and has gone down near the target building. We have to get men to that position ASAP.
      <cFC8932>Weather:<-co>  Clear, hot.
      <cFC8932>Terrain:<-co>  Urban - City center.
      <cFC8932>Enemy:<-co>  Estimated 500 Habr Gedir militia equipped with small arms and RPG's. Technicals w/ .50 caliber mounted weapons.
      <cFC8932>Friendly:<-co>  None

2. <ucFC8932>Mission<-uco> 
      <cFC8932>Who:<-co> Delta 5-1, Ranger 4-2
      <cFC8932>What:<-co> Move by convoy to crash site, provide security and first aid.
      <cFC8932>When:<-co> Immediately.

3. <ucFC8932>Execution<-uco>
      <cFC8932>Commanders Intent:<-co>  Get a team of men to the crash site. Assess the wounded and secure the area until extraction can be made.
      <cFC8932>Concept of Operation:<-co>  Use the extraction convoy to get a team close to the crash. Move the rest of the way on foot and set up a secure perimeter. C-SAR is in route to provide medical attention.
Coordinating instructions - C-SAR will radio in when they are nearing the site.

4. <ucFC8932>Service and Support<-uco>
      <cFC8932>Basic Load:<-co>  M21, Colt .45, Claymores

5. <ucFC8932>Command and signal<-uco>
	CSAR, Five One and convoy lead will be in direct communication with command in aerial recon.";

